{"comment_text": {"ja51:0.1": "", "ja51:0.2": "", "ja51:0.3": "", "ja51:0.4": "", "ja51:1.1": "A good king deposed by a violent foe is subjected to brutal torture, but neither slips from his virtue nor loses hope. Persevering, he eventually regains the crown. | <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Āsīsetha</i> is reflexive third singular optative. ", "ja51:1.2": "", "ja51:1.3": "", "ja51:1.4": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Ahūti</i> is <i lang='pi' translate='no'>ahu</i> + <i lang='pi' translate='no'>(i)ti</i>, where <i lang='pi' translate='no'>ahu</i> is reflexive first singular aorist. ", "ja51:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja51:0.1": "<article id='ja51'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja51:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja51:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja51:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja51:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja51:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja51:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja51:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja51:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja51:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja51:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja51:0.3": "Āsīsavagga ", "ja51:0.4": "1. Mahāsīlavajātaka ", "ja51:1.1": "“Āsīsetheva puriso, ", "ja51:1.2": "na nibbindeyya paṇḍito; ", "ja51:1.3": "Passāmi vohaṁ attānaṁ, ", "ja51:1.4": "yathā icchiṁ tathā ahū”ti. ", "ja51:2.1": "Mahāsīlavajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja51:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 51 ", "ja51:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja51:0.3": "Hope ", "ja51:0.4": "The Great Virtuous One: a past life story ", "ja51:1.1": "A man should have hope, ", "ja51:1.2": "the astute should not be disillusioned. ", "ja51:1.3": "Now I truly see myself—", "ja51:1.4": "as I wished, so I became. ", "ja51:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja51:0.1": "", "ja51:0.2": "", "ja51:0.3": "", "ja51:0.4": "", "ja51:1.1": "Āsīsetheva → āsiṁsetheva (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja51:1.2": "", "ja51:1.3": "", "ja51:1.4": "", "ja51:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja51:0.1": "", "ja51:0.2": "", "ja51:0.3": "", "ja51:0.4": "", "ja51:1.1": "bj30.22, csp1ed22.13, csp2ed22.13, dr27.18, ms22J_113, msdiv51, ndp22.14, pts-vp-pli1.267", "ja51:1.2": "", "ja51:1.3": "", "ja51:1.4": "", "ja51:2.1": "ms22J_114"}, "keys_order": ["ja51:0.1", "ja51:0.2", "ja51:0.3", "ja51:0.4", "ja51:1.1", "ja51:1.2", "ja51:1.3", "ja51:1.4", "ja51:2.1"]}